Package: faissR
Type: Package
Title: Nearest Neighbours, Prediction, and Clustering with 'FAISS'
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Stefano",
    family = "Cacciatore",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tkcaccia@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7052-7156")),
    person("Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates", role = "cph",
        comment = "Bundled FAISS source; see inst/COPYRIGHTS"))
Description: Provides exact and approximate nearest-neighbour search,
    k-nearest neighbour prediction, and k-means clustering for dense data.
    Uses the Facebook AI Similarity Search ('FAISS') C++ library for CPU
    indexes, with optional 'NVIDIA CUDA' and 'RAPIDS cuVS' providers for GPU
    execution. Supports Euclidean, cosine, and correlation distances,
    reusable fitted indexes, and single-precision input and output.
    Classification models return predicted labels and class probabilities;
    regression models return predicted responses. Uses a compatible installed
    'FAISS' library or builds the included CPU source. CPU builds do not
    require GPU libraries.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tkcaccia/faissR
BugReports: https://github.com/tkcaccia/faissR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
