SystemRequirements: C++20, GNU make, patch, OpenMP, Fortran on Unix,
    complete LP64
    BLAS and LAPACK including single-precision routines (Debian/Ubuntu:
    libblas-dev, liblapack-dev; Fedora: blas-devel, lapack-devel; Windows:
    Rtools numerical libraries; macOS: R-compatible OpenMP and numerical
    libraries). FAISS >= 1.11.0 is used when available; otherwise the bundled
    CPU source is compiled. Optional CUDA and cuVS libraries are needed only
    for GPU-enabled builds.
